      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SIMPLY INSPIRING (1) gets the top billing from the pole draw, with the Grant Dixon stable and Jack Chapple combination adding weight to her second-up profile. She was only fourth behind Commanche Bling in a No NR here last week, but this maiden does not look deep and the draw gives her the chance to improve. BILLY IDEAL (6) has the strongest direct form from that same race, having run second and beaten SIMPLY INSPIRING, though he was near the top of betting and still beaten nine metres. MISTER CEE CEE (5) resumes after a nose second here in August and a third in an Albion Park trial, so he is a genuine danger if forward enough. MISTA WICKED (8) has a neck third here two back but must rebound from a plain sixth last week.",
